# Optional expansions found by ek.expansion.ExpansionRegistry and offered in the setup menu.
# Register one class implementing ek.expansion.Expansion per line, e.g.
#   ek.imploding.ImplodingKittens
# Expansions must live in an ek. package: only ek.** classes may cross the network
# (ek.net.ObjectStreamChannel.FILTER), and their card types are sent to the clients.
# The base game is always included and must not be listed. An expansion can also come in
# its own jar on the classpath with its own META-INF/services file.
